        "page": {
            "become_a_dealer": "Become a Dealer",
            "confirmation": {
                "dealer": "On behalf of all of us at LEVEL5, thank you for your interest in representing our tools!<br/><br/>Your dealer application was successfully received at our office. You can expect a response from our Retailer Sales Department within two working days.",
                "support_request": "Your support request was successfully received at our office. You can expect a response from our Support Department within two working days.",
                "warranty": "Your warranty registration was successfully received at our office. If there are any issues with your registration, we will reach out to you.<br/><br/>Any questions or concerns? Feel free to reach out to us at <a href='tel:18002277713'>800.227.7713</a> or by email at <a href='mailto:info@level5tools.com'>info@level5tools.com</a>."
            },
            "financing": {
                "as_a_pro": "As a professional drywall finisher, you understand the importance of having the right tools to maximize your efficiency and profits. If you haven’t got the savings to purchase, or you want to preserve your cash flow, our flexible financing options could be the ideal solution.",
                "btn-browse-1": "/automatic-finishing",
                "btn-browse-2": "/automatic-finishing",
                "faq": {
                    "question-1": {
                        "description": "<h3>ONE LOW FIXED MONTHLY PAYMENT</h3><p>Monthly rental rates on a full set of automatic tools is typically $500 per month or more. <strong>Through LEVEL5 financing, you can own the same tools at a fraction of the monthly cost.</strong> In addition, at the end of your financing term, there is no balloon payment or any other hidden charges. The tools are yours.</p><h3>&zwj;ALL THE SAME BENEFITS OF OWNERSHIP&zwj;</h3><p>During your financing term,<strong> you have all of the rights and privileges of full ownership,</strong> including full coverage by the LEVEL5 warranty, access to after-sales service and technical support, product training, etc. Know that LEVEL5 offers an industry-leading 7-year, no hassle warranty on all of its automatic drywall finishing tools. This means the manufacturing workmanship of your tools will be backed by us for many years beyond the expiry of your contract.&nbsp;</p><h3>MORE FINANCIAL CONTROL&zwj;</h3><p>Cash is the lifeblood of any business. So why use it up purchasing capital assets (including tools)? You are able to conserve your business savings and bank lines of credit for other important expenditures that will help you to support and grow your business (such as a new truck or trailer).</p><h3>MONTHLY PAYMENTS ARE TAX DEDUCTIBLE</h3><p><strong>Talk to your accountant.</strong> The interest on your financing payments can typically be deducted as business expenses on your tax return, reducing the net cost of your financing. Tax deductions are one of the biggest advantages of small equipment financing.&nbsp;</p><h3>DEVELOP A CREDIT PARTNERSHIP WITH LEVEL5</h3><p>We&rsquo;re here to support your success. financing partnership,<strong> you have an opportunity to build a strong, prosperous credit relationship with LEVEL5 and our financing partners.</strong> We can continue to fund your tooling needs in the future as you grow and thrive.</p>",
                        "title": "<div class='text-block-9'>What are the key advantages of financing vs. renting?</div>"
                    },
                    "question-2": {
                        "description": "<p>The calculation of your monthly payment amount is a function of three variables:</p><ol><li>The configuration of the tool set you require and its cost;</li><li>The term of the financing that you choose;</li><li>Your credit history.</li></ol><p>Your credit score is not affected when you submit an initial application. Why not apply and see what is offered by our financing partner? There is no obligation and the final decision to accept the loan terms is yours.</p>",
                        "title": "<div class='text-block-9'>How much will my monthly payment be?</div>"
                    },
                    "question-3": {
                        "description": "<p>Interest rates on unsecured small equipment capital financings is highly variable, but the algorithm is primarily influenced by your credit record and the term of the financing that you choose. <strong>The rates can be as low as 4% per annum.</strong></p>",
                        "title": "<div class='text-block-9'>What is the interest rate for my financing?</div>"
                    },
                    "question-4": {
                        "description": "<p><strong>There is no balloon payment or any other hidden fees at the end of your financing term.&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Know that LEVEL5 offers an industry-leading 7-year, no hassle warranty on all of its automatic drywall finishing tools. This means the manufacturing workmanship of your tools will be backed by us for many years beyond the expiry of your contract.</p>",
                        "title": "<div class='text-block-9'>Is there a balloon payment at the end of the financing term?</div>"
                    },
                    "question-5": {
                        "description": "<p>Yes! A loan with our financing partner Credit Key includes flexible payment terms. If you pay off the balance in full early, any future interest that would have been due for the remaining months of the loan is avoided. Also, there are no penalties or fees for early repayment.</p>",
                        "title": "<div class='text-block-9'>Can I payoff my financing early?</div>"
                    },
                    "question-number": "5"
                },
                "financing_partner": {
                    "head-1": {
                        "id": "credit--key",
                        "name": "Credit Key",
                        "img": "https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-89a9ntp16/images/stencil/original/image-manager/credit-key.png",
                        "description": "For businesses looking for a line of credit.",
                        "point": "5",
                        "point-1": "0% interest for 90 days",
                        "point-2": "Up to 12 month terms",
                        "point-3": "No early payment penalties",
                        "point-4": "Available for orders $1500+",
                        "point-5": "Maximum of $50k available"
                    },
                    "head-2": {
                        "id": "paypal--monthly",
                        "name": "Paypal monthly",
                        "pay-type": "Pay Monthly",
                        "img": "https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-89a9ntp16/images/stencil/original/image-manager/paypal.png",
                        "description": "Break up payments into monthly instalments.",
                        "point": "5",
                        "point-1": "6, 12 & 24 month terms",
                        "point-2": "APRs from 9.99% - 35.99%",
                        "point-3": "For individuals & businesses",
                        "point-4": "Available for orders $1500+",
                        "point-5": "Must have a PayPal account"
                    },
                    "head-3": {
                        "id": "klarna--",
                        "name": "Klarna",
                        "img": "https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-89a9ntp16/images/stencil/original/image-manager/klarna-1.png",
                        "description": "Split your payment into 4 interest-free payments.",
                        "point": "5",
                        "point-1": "Pay only 25% down",
                        "point-2": "No fees for on-time payments",
                        "point-3": "No effect on credit score",
                        "point-4": "For orders under $1500",
                        "point-5": "Pay through the Klarna app"
                    },
                    "head-4": {
                        "id": "paypal--in4",
                        "name": "Paypal in 4",
                        "pay-type": "Pay-In-4",
                        "img": "https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-89a9ntp16/images/stencil/original/image-manager/paypal.png",
                        "description": "Use PayPal to split your payments into 4 chunks.",
                        "point": "5",
                        "point-1": "Pay only 25% down",
                        "point-2": "No fees for on-time payments",
                        "point-3": "No effect on credit score",
                        "point-4": "For orders under $1500",
                        "point-5": "Payments made via PayPal"
                    },
                    "total": "4"
                },
                "financing_toolset": "Level5 Financing",
                "get-tools": {
                    "head-1": {
                        "description": "<p class='card--text white'>LEVEL5 offers a wide range of automatic tool sets to choose from. You even have the flexibility to customize a set tailored to your specific needs.</p>",
                        "title": "<h4 class='head--title white'>Pick your ideal tool set</h4>"
                    },
                    "head-2": {
                        "description": "<p class='card--text white'>Once you’ve chosen the tools you need, simply submit an application as an individual or a business. Our approval system will have a response for you within hours.</p>",
                        "title": "<h4 class='head--title white'>Start your application</h4>"
                    },
                    "head-3": {
                        "description": "<p class='card--text white'>Once your application is approved, our team will get the tools shipped out to you within just 3 to 5 days. We’ll also cover the shipping to anywhere across the continental USA!</p>",
                        "title": "<h4 class='head--title white'>Place your order!</h4>"
                    },
                    "total": "3"
                },
                "get_tools_now": "Get the tools you need now, with low monthly payments!",
                "our_most_popular_tool": "Our most popular tool sets",
                "want_to_learn_more_custom": "Want to learn more or customize your own custom tool set for financing? Get in touch with us!",
                "why-finance": {
                    "head-1": {
                        "description": "Browse our website and add the LEVEL5 tools you need to your cart. For assistance, don't hesitate to call our support team at <a class='link' href='tel:+18002277713'>800.277.7713.</a>",
                        "title": "Pick your tools"
                    },
                    "head-2": {
                        "description": "When ready, go to the website checkout, enter your shipping &amp; billing information, then select from the <a class='link' href='#stepbystepfinance'>financing options available.</a>",
                        "title": "Head to Checkout"
                    },
                    "head-3": {
                        "description": "Click <b>“place order”</b>. You will be guided through the financing application. Once approved, we ship your tools immediately!",
                        "title": "Apply & Order!"
                    },
                    "total": "3"
                },
                "why_finance_with_l5": "Finance with Level5?"
            },
